in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/texas/brazoria-county"],["ARC or PLC in Brazoria County","/arc-plc/texas/brazoria-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 13 grids in Brazoria County came in under 90% of normal in March to April in 41 of 75 years on record since 1951. In 2025 the middle of the grids ran 52% of normal in September to October and 42% in November to December. So far in 2026 it flipped, with April to May at 161% and May to June at 183% on the middle of the grids.</p>"}
